        "en": "Remote Control (Dafeiyu)",
        "zh": "手机远控（大肥鱼定制）"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Control DSH from your phone: sessions, chat, approvals, model switching. Settings page ships an Android app QR code. Also backs sessions up to your own private git repo.",
